    {
        "content": "<p>I'm not sure why the arguments are ordered this way, but I would want to see some evidence that we've searched for previous discussion, and a draft toolchain to see what breaks when changing the order!</p>\n<p>But the basic answer here is quoted from the doc-string for HEq: \"You should avoid using this type if you can.\"</p>",
